    "text": "2 days ago Morris Township Police Department Joins National Prescription Drug Take Back Day on April 25, 2026. Morris County Prosecutor Robert J. Carroll, Chief of Detectives Robert McNally, Morris County Sheriff James M. Gannon, Morris Plains Police Chief Mike Koroski, Morris Township Police Chief Robert Shearer, and Randolph Township Police Chief Keith Donovan announce that on Saturday, April 25, 2026, they will be participating in the annual National Prescription Drug Take Back Day program. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
